        },
        {
          "text": "Emikuzi esatu buli mwaka, Solomoni yaaghangayo ku alutaari ye yazimbira Musengwa Katonda, ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa n'ebigheebwayo olw'okutabagana. Era yaaniokezanga obubbaani mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda. Kale yaamaliriza eisinzizo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
