              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaja mu nsi Ofiri, baatoolayo zaabu agheza kilo ng'oti enkumi ina (4,000), baamuleetera kyabazinga Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
